/// <reference lib="deno.ns" />
// PPI · telegram Edge Function (database update 66): the Cacaduu Telegram bot for shop owners, phase 1
//
// One bot for all shops. Telegram calls this function's webhook; every update must carry Telegram's secret header
// (X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token = TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET), otherwise 401. An owner links Telegram on the website
// (a one-time code, t.me/<bot>?start=<code>) and ticks shops and permissions there; that consent is an owner-MCP grant
// (update 61) whose token stays in the Vault. EVERY tool the bot uses goes through telegram_call() = owner_mcp_call(),
// the owner MCP's one door (scopes, the shop in the grant, membership, the plan, rate limits) — never another write
// path. Every write waits for "Potvrdiť" (telegram_pending: 10 minutes, once) and shows before → after first.
//
//   - Telegram (header X-Telegram-Bot-Api-Secret-Token): messages and button presses in private chats only
//     (groups and channels are refused with a message); unknown users only get "Prepojte Telegram…".
//   - the admin (their login + is_admin): action "webhook_info" | "set_webhook" (Telegram's setWebhook with the secret).
// Buttons first (no AI): Dnes · Hodiny · Rezervácie · Sklad · Správy · Kontakty · Stav obchodu; /odpojit unlinks.
// Free text (phase 2): Claude (AI_MODEL) reads through the same door and may only PROPOSE changes (propose_* tools →
// the same "Potvrdiť" message); the admin's switch, the owner's switch per shop and 50 messages a day
// (telegram_ai_hit). Notifications (phase 3, opt-in per shop): x-ppi-cron (Vault ppi_telegram_cron) → action notify →
// telegram_notify_due (quiet hours, 30 a day, access) → one message each → telegram_notify_result.
// Texts: the "telegram" namespace of src/i18n/messages/{sk,hu,en}.json, copied below by scripts/telegram-texts.mjs
// (npm run test:telegram fails when the copy differs). Never logged: messages, names, phones, tokens, codes.
//
// Deploy: Supabase → Edge Functions → "telegram" → paste this file → Deploy; "Verify JWT" OFF (it checks its callers).
// Secrets: TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET; SITE_URL, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, AI_MODEL (already set).
// Without TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN the bot is off (nothing is sent) and the admin page says so.

